# Internal notes are not part of the product.
#
# firestore.rules.PATCH.md was already being served publicly at
# https://financing.csebuilders.com/firestore.rules.PATCH.md — thirteen
# kilobytes describing the security rules, readable by anyone who guessed the
# filename. README.md and RULES.md were not live only because they postdate
# the last deploy; the next one would have published them too.
#
# A document explaining how the gate works is not a vulnerability on its own,
# but it is free reconnaissance, and none of it is anything a customer needs.
*.md

.env*
.vercel
